    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERCOME OBSTACLES AND PUSH YOUR LIMITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an intense journey in this electrifying 3D platformer, where you control a wheelchair through dynamic and unpredictable challenges. With multiple game modes \u2014 including a 10-level campaign and endless runner challenges \u2014 this offline singleplayer game puts your skills and reflexes to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid movement</strong> \u2013 Full control of the wheelchair: move, jump, and maneuver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing difficulty</strong> \u2013 Each level pushes your precision and agility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable obstacles</strong> \u2013 Ramps, moving platforms, slippery areas, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized visuals</strong> \u2013 Vibrant low-poly art filled with creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline &amp; singleplayer</strong> \u2013 Play at your own pace, anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong> \u2013 Earn a grade at the end of each run and challenge your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAN YOU MAKE IT TO THE END?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/956d7752507103f69bc559871506c781.avif?t=1753326039\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love skill-based challenges, precise platforming, and epic moments of overcoming the odds \u2014 <strong>this game was made for you!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERCOME OBSTACLES AND PUSH YOUR LIMITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an intense journey in this electrifying 3D platformer, where you control a wheelchair through dynamic and unpredictable challenges. With multiple game modes \u2014 including a 10-level campaign and endless runner challenges \u2014 this offline singleplayer game puts your skills and reflexes to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid movement</strong> \u2013 Full control of the wheelchair: move, jump, and maneuver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing difficulty</strong> \u2013 Each level pushes your precision and agility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable obstacles</strong> \u2013 Ramps, moving platforms, slippery areas, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized visuals</strong> \u2013 Vibrant low-poly art filled with creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline &amp; singleplayer</strong> \u2013 Play at your own pace, anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong> \u2013 Earn a grade at the end of each run and challenge your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAN YOU MAKE IT TO THE END?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/956d7752507103f69bc559871506c781.avif?t=1753326039\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love skill-based challenges, precise platforming, and epic moments of overcoming the odds \u2014 <strong>this game was made for you!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p>",
